symbols.desc:
The canonical host list.
 Retired hosts stay here with `enabled = false` so the reason they were dropped survives;
 delete an entry only when the reason no longer needs recording.

[skill] = { [type] = { lvl, exp, ... } }
 The exp is being used to calculate players skill exp,
 and level based on dailybonus and percentage of skill level

Tools that can deal damage but must stay usable by players blacklisted from "w" access.
 Damage these weapons deal to other players is voided while the attacker lacks "w" access;
 damage to props/entities (mining, logging, etc.) is unaffected.
